1
00:00:03,948 --> 00:00:05,208
Let's zoom in!

2
00:00:05,823 --> 00:00:08,083
Look! A warm ball of bees!

3
00:00:09,037 --> 00:00:11,857
Wow! Some bees shake their wing muscles!

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,641
Do all butterflies stay?

5
00:00:14,661 --> 00:00:15,831
Nope!

6
00:00:15,851 --> 00:00:17,131
These monarchs fly

7
00:00:17,151 --> 00:00:19,051
all the way to Mexico!

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,240
Huddle, fly away, or hide!

9
00:00:24,397 --> 00:00:26,597
Who is hiding under here?

10
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,550
One, two, three... so many!

11
00:00:29,828 --> 00:00:32,968
Some ladybugs nap together under leaves!

12
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,350
Six legs? In you go!

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,040
Is it spring yet?

14
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,350
Nope!

15
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,440
Huddle, fly away, or hide!

16
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:47,330
Can YOU huddle like a bee?
